---
title: Norwegian Fruit Soup
author: Grandma Gustad
category: Soups
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@apples{2} (peeled and sliced)
@slices of peeled oranges{2}
@slices of peeled lemons{2}
@tapioca{4%Tbsp}
@sugar{1/2%c}
@liquid (water/juice from fruit){3%qts}
@prunes{1/2%lb}
@seedless raisins{1/2%lb}
@dried apricots{1/2%lb}
@cinnamon candies{1/2%c}
@cooked plums{8-10}
@cooked peaches{2}

Wash dry fruit and soak overnight in water. To this add fruit juices, apples, lemons, oranges, tapioca, sugar and cinnamon candies. Simmer for 1/2 hour. Add cooked sliced fruit and let stand 3-4 hours to mellow.
